      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews document successful outcomes for vaccinations, dental cleaning plans, and general medical therapies for cats and dogs. Pet owners appreciate straightforward explanations regarding diagnoses and preventive treatments. The clinical team helps pet parents maintain their animals in good health through consistent medical oversight."
      }
