      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners describe the hospital as an economical choice in South Los Angeles, citing fair exam fees and accessible preventive care. Clinicians frequently suggest budget-conscious dental and wellness options. In contrast, a few reviewers reported unexpected medication fees and extra sedation charges for bathing services."
      }
    }
